    "The Incoterm is CIF Guayaquil (Ecuador), and page 3 also gives Guayaquil as the port of loading. The supplier is in Lima, Peru, and the final destination is Lusaka, Zambia. CIF to the loading port makes no commercial sense. Please confirm the named place with the supplier.",
    "There is a discount column, so the unit prices are list prices (price_basis 'list'). I calculated pack prices as unit list price x units per pack, before discount.",
